# CODEOWNERS — review routing
#
# ⚠️  GitHub SILENTLY IGNORES any owner that lacks write access to this repository.
#     Adding a handle here does nothing until that user (or team) is a collaborator.
#     Verify with:  gh api repos/<owner>/<repo>/collaborators/<user> -i
#     A 404 means the line below is inert.
#
# Prefer teams (@org/team) over individuals — they survive people changing roles.
# Last matching pattern wins, so order matters.

# ── Default ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project owner plus the Cornerstone platform owners, who review anything not matched
# by a more specific rule below.
#
# ⚠️  PUBLIC / OSS PROJECTS: remove the two platform handles from this line. They are
#     internal Grupo Deacero accounts and must not appear in a public repository.
*                               @myuser @jalban-ext_deacero @ktouma_deacero

# ── Guardrails and gates ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gate scripts are enforcement logic: changing one changes what the whole project is
# allowed to do. These should never be self-merged.
/tools/                         @myuser
/.agents/AGENTS.gates.md        @myuser
/.claude/settings.json          @myuser
/.gemini/                       @myuser

# ── Agent skills and protocols ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SKILL.md files are executable prompt logic (ADR-0021), not documentation — a change
# here alters agent behaviour on every session and is subject to the ADR gate.
/.agents/                       @myuser

# ── Infrastructure and CI/CD ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/workflows/             @myuser
/.github/dependabot.yml         @myuser
/Dockerfile                     @myuser
/docker-compose.yml             @myuser
/pyproject.toml                 @myuser

# ── Architecture ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ADRs are immutable once accepted: supersede, never edit.
/docs/adr/   @myuser

# ── Knowledge base ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The learning gate reads FINDINGS.md; it is shared state, not personal notes.
/docs/knowledge/                @myuser
